==English==
===Proper noun===
'''Disney'''

# A family name.
# [[Walt Disney]].
# [[w:The Walt Disney Company|The Walt Disney Company]], an entertainment company founded by Walt and Roy Disney, well known for producing [[animated film]]s, performing [[stage musical]]s{{,}} and operating [[theme park]]s.
# The [[w:Walt Disney Pictures|Walt Disney Pictures]] or former Walt Disney Productions film banners.
# Any of the theme parks and vacation resorts operated by [[w:Walt Disney Parks and Resorts|Walt Disney Parks and Resorts]].
# The [[w:Disney Channel|Disney Channel]], a cable television network.